{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46283","headline":"戊辰岁湘中寄郑谷郎中 · 齐己","name":"戊辰岁湘中寄郑谷郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白发久慵簪，常闻病亦吟。\n瘦应成鹤骨，闲想似禅心。\n上国杨花乱，沧洲荻笋深。\n不堪思翠巘，西望独沾襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46283.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46283","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}